From d4ba11ae23f4778c8d13c1ad0b09900d6f72d71c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bvchess <53128914+bvchess@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:37:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] e1_smooth: E12's variants: --chain-forced takes only the
 hubs some fiber takes in every choice; --probe solves each child S of a chain
 at once, gives the fibers the hubs whose child S is dead, for free, and
 leaves the others undecided; --no-root-check lets a leaf of an instance be
 dependent in the root's frames (a valid bound, no longer at most PB_sh); the
 circuits counted at nodes with a hub given to no fiber

